            "description": {
              "content": "Verifies whether 3D Secure is available for the specified BIN or card brand. For 3D Secure 2, this endpoint also returns device fingerprinting keys.\n\nFor more information, refer to [3D Secure 2](https://docs.adyen.com/online-payments/3d-secure/native-3ds2).",
